contentText:
Cody Simpson has hit an unexpected roadblock as he promotes new music and closes in on finishing his next album. The Australian singer revealed on Monday (May 11) that he suffered &#8220;a serious hemorrhage&#8221; on one of his vocal cords, causing him to seek medical treatment and go on strict vocal rest to avoid further injury while still continuing to work on his next batch of songs.

